{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】「MegaHouse」攤位報導！坐姿及貓化公仔應有盡有！「火影忍者」「咒術迴戰」等</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/30efadae523a7a7e1f7235d24c3c1192bd43fed80c710af3f56042e4a6a655e7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F49802f03f3d6e7c07fe1b8ba4d4cef92\"/><p>於2026年7月24日(五)～28日(二)舉辦的「 ACGHK 2026 」－「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026(香港動漫電玩節2026)」 本次為大家介紹推出可愛公仔的「 MegaHouse 」攤位！</p><h3>「MegaHouse」攤位報導！人氣角色Q版公仔齊聚一堂</h3><p>「MegaHouse」攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/39617e47f8473291a641784e594819b439978e5e24a73675150e09bf5c1f391d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0ac247b6d86fe1c20dea76b3349f7e14\"/><p>來到萬代南夢宮集團的「 MegaHouse 」攤位！</p><p>「Look Up」系列</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/07f8730ca3f74d2f2d4a5ec0affc539ffd461c91f0808632e4133a8f83bb7528/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fed813e5ad9a9ef240cff6b2183e18ff1\"/><p>展示了角色彷彿抬頭仰望般凝視著你的全新感覺公仔「 Look Up 」系列。</p><p>發現魯夫！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/34af28f1fb72c8d0b4f7d545e74c1df1855196210be41ca3ee263a9df2db4f12/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc4a05292e6cb1ee3c2ca71205b9df95f\"/><p>入口處有大型Look Up以及「 MEGA CAT PROJECT 」化的「海賊王」魯夫迎接來賓！ 雖然經過Q版化，但角色特色依然完美重現。</p><p>引人目光的微微張開的嘴巴</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4112d8a77685a2e7fda33cd07d374bf1c1bf9409ebaa4b722eec0c6dea386df0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb8487820041c2441ecc5e9e3be6923e3\"/><p>還看到了大型的「排球少年!!」影山飛雄。 向上看的眼神好可愛……。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/57fc8f7ee430fdfb14dbcbf281a243c25de05ffc23baac28175610d10de7bb8a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1d6d759479f9624be29168ef3229ec3b\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7d2e970406d50afa941146c6234e2337115c18b38e86070aed29f95a2ab96a30/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd8d8e7986ad446e3a7d2af43d31c1067\"/><p>現場也展示了其他一般尺寸的「排球少年!!」角色。 披上 Look Up專用雨披 的模樣也很棒。</p><p>親子共演</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ce0e68e3e6ccdd313ee2fa6f606d19cd17f734f5274805956de7c75619672447/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2e411d590f13025b62900baa13f4fc82\"/><p>「火影忍者」的鳴人(六道仙人模式)及鼬等人也坐得乖乖的。 迪達拉嘴角上揚的表情被重現了，令人開心……！</p><p>知名作品一字排開</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4141d55578dee3973ae423397b13899014a7e0278f2b3a6a42b77fa5e5f8d688/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4cf36b43969cc17951d8f65ecee6872c\"/><p>「膽大黨」、「賽馬娘」、「葬送的芙莉蓮」、「犬夜叉」等許多人氣作品齊聚。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e09d20f370bb45e05c94b07658ef8d930109e56653756c306a41191dd3e00b15/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F571fb99977773f166ec5f25eb583e25f\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0acc8395642a8fb4bd76612ce9f4d96dc01e3eac9496956ef45b1a782a00438e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff425f879331a3700902bd5fa33d2f649\"/><p>「我的英雄學院」的綠谷出久、轟焦凍等人。 穿制服的坐姿令人無法抗拒。</p><p>表情各自不同</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/76bd922161a7201648adb09e83b4bf96ebfddf58ea6a168d83e2d8b2def1500a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2e2314fbd9fc8adcd16f6d00378ada84\"/><p>「咒術迴戰」的虎杖悠仁、五條悟、夏油傑等人。 沒有發生爭鬥，一片祥和。</p><p>展示方式也很好</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ab7313ddec785ac64133447d296f2844da20724f03d71a9ddf5db010fb34243e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa72e3c11f53a992ae0c38296aae908e0\"/><p>「海賊王」有許多角色 Look Up化 ！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/48df574b087d65d437cc3e80308c049e7d84b6ed2a127658e224c336da15cb7c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F12fdda5582d8501a5afa74ffa0ebcb79\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1059819421d496fea5adea889edf9449f96725d62c3af5eb8680e71c2e51525c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fab28dfd25c0d64c0d46e95f0396b3a88\"/><p>艾斯的笑容真棒。 喬巴的身材比例幾乎沒變，好可愛。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ef44079c34722b5437ef13c89686341b2c9874dba8512b6bffd0b2fadfd0ce86/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbea4ad11817e31987293b2e6530ad4f4\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e113d5d587cfbbe884a584857003105b071dc834df185e82f7dc72690ac2e463/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd29f28ae98bbcbe738a4ae84b9a90b6b\"/><p>魯夫的五檔與大和，還有穿著哥德蘿莉風的培羅娜。 令人想成套收藏。</p><p>「MEGA CAT PROJECT」系列</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0af33a0eeed846c813e69a3e2ee2c17aa501039d0889f0458bab4c0d0abb7823/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F42d2397c5dedbd500c209d012426ee28\"/><p>現場也展示了 MEGA CAT PROJECT ！ 貓化角色一字排開。</p><p>忍者貓</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/983e0582ce09e1ede5151464667cac3bf605d8351ccbd675e56f641061335f2c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3495be4282492fe984a5576c985084b5\"/><p>「火影忍者」的佐助和小櫻。 那表情看起來像是永遠不會離開村子、乖乖待在家裡的樣子。</p><p>介紹文字也值得關注</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c4a321dea43182daad68a3839cf4979c787d576cac419fe677919c62d5de0c4e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe8477eaf39b7a5c8274060495120ee36\"/><p>鳴人與伊魯卡老師。 保留貓咪感的同時，髮型也忠實重現，好厲害！</p><p>被收進去了</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3e8220f5721de513337da56a4583cdc89f1ccb9126eb2edeb478e9f4bf3c1077/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1316041a87c089e33a1345725bad445d\"/><p>和我愛羅的Look Up放在一起。 讓人忍不住想收齊的可愛。</p><p>各具特色</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ebd76a4286e50b7dc184b3d88020aba8e4deafe38a1881304e6ae175c2447a24/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4ce24e5b02cf7e838de1de903052eca1\"/><p>「咒術迴戰」的甚爾，其銳利的眼神非常適合貓化造型。</p><p>以上是匯集了可愛又高品質公仔的「MegaHouse」攤位報導！</p><p>🔸【ACGHK 2026】「Good Smile Company」「GOD HAND」攤位報導！從賽車初音到香港限定剪鉗，內容豐富！ 🔸萬代南夢宮娛樂確定參展「TGS2026」&amp;特設網站公開！最新作品試玩及週邊販售資訊同步公開 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「TAMASHII NATIONS」攤位報導！展示七龍珠、海賊王等珍貴公仔 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「Swarovski」攤位報導！人氣角色的超華麗水晶公仔令人目不轉睛 🔸【ACGHK 2026】BANDAI SPIRITS「30 MINUTES LABEL」攤位報導！展示超時空要塞、鋼彈、偶像大師等高品質塑膠模型</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:49.873427+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1263,"images":22,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}